<title>USA: Limited sees higher Q3, Q4 earnings.</title>
<headline>Limited sees higher Q3, Q4 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Limited Inc said on Thursday it expects net income for the third quarter, ended November 2, of $40 million, or $0.15 per share, excluding a gain from the sale of Abercrombie &amp; Fitch stock.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income in the same period last year was $27 million, or $0.10 per share, the company said.</p>
</text>
